{
  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 460 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["E13", "E16"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "The lactulose on our labels is manufactured by Xttrium Laboratories, Inc. (FEI 3008436464) as shown on the product label.",
      "cites": ["E16"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1273417 of that plant ended on 2025-06-18 and was classified Official Action Indicated (OAI), with the classification known on 2025-09-16.",
      "cites": ["E13"]
    },
    {
      "text": "That OAI classification occurred 460 days before the shortage posting date of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E13"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The plant's most recent inspection, FDA inspection 1324176, ended on 2026-06-16 and was classified Voluntary Action Indicated (VAI).",
      "cites": ["E14"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 223 units with 24 days on hand at current use, while Corvale Lakeside holds 35 units with 19 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The recommended option is to buy from APOZEAL PHARMACEUTICALS INC., which is not on FDA's shortage list today and its label names no plant we could place.",
      "cites": []
    }
  ]
}
